{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52422","headline":"回波乐 六十五 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 六十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"道从欢喜生，还从瞋恚灭。\n佛性[盈两]（两盈）间，由人作巧拙。\n天堂在目前，地狱非虚说。\n努力善思量，终身须急结。\n斩断三毒箭，恩爱亦难绝。\n明识大乘因，镬汤亦不热。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52422.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52422","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}